@startuml activity-my-listings
' Spec 003 — the employer's own list, the owner view, and ownership (REQ-003-10, -13, -14)
title My listings and ownership (REQ-003-10/13/14)

start
:Employer opens "My listings";
:Load only this employer's listings;
if (Any listings?) then (no)
  :Empty state with "Post a job";
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:Show most recently changed first:
title, region, salary,
status label, "x of 3 open listings used";
:Employer taps a listing
(or opens its address directly);
if (Listing belongs to this employer?) then (no)
  :Not found — same as a
  listing that does not exist;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:Show status and what happens next;
:Show the listing as visitors will see it
(business name, salary, region, sections);
:Offer only the actions the status allows;
stop
@enduml
